      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَقْمَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Plague,</i> or <i>pestilence;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعُونٌ</span>. (Th,
K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمَاهُ ٱللّٰهُ بِالزَّقْمَةِ</span> [<i>God smote him,</i>
or <i>may God smite him, with the plague,</i> or <i>pestilence</i>]. (TK.)

